{"entries":[{"id":"tsk-psa-87-1","title":"Psalms 87:1","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"PSA","chapterStart":87,"verseStart":1,"chapterEnd":87,"verseEnd":1},"content":"<p>1 The nature and glory of the church. 4 The increase, honour, and comfort of the members thereof.</p>\n<p>A.M. 3468. B.C. 536. (Title.) A Psalm.It is highly probable that this Psalm was written by one of the descendants of Korah on the return from the Bablonian captivity. It seems to have been written in praise of Jerusalem; and, typically, of the Christian church.</p>\n<p>for. or, of. His. 2Ch 3:1; Isa 28:16; Mt 16:18; 1Co 3:10,11; Eph 2:20-22; 1Pe 2:4-8 the holy. 48:1,2; 68:16; 121:1; Isa 2:2,3; 56:7; Zec 8:3; 2Pe 1:18</p>"},{"id":"tsk-psa-87-2","title":"Psalms 87:2","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"PSA","chapterStart":87,"verseStart":2,"chapterEnd":87,"verseEnd":2},"content":"<p>The Lord. 78:67-69; 132:13,14; De 12:5; 2Ch 6:6; Isa 14:32; Joe 2:32</p>"},{"id":"tsk-psa-87-3","title":"Psalms 87:3","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"PSA","chapterStart":87,"verseStart":3,"chapterEnd":87,"verseEnd":3},"content":"<p>Glorious. 48:2,3,11-13; 125:1,2; Isa 12:6; 49:14-26; 54:2-10; 59:20,21 Isa 60:1-22; 61:3-11; 62:1-12; Jer 3:14-17; 31:12,13 Eze 36:2,11-38; 37:27,28; 40:1-49; 48:1-35; Heb 12:22,23; Re 14:1 Re 21:10-27</p>"},{"id":"tsk-psa-87-4","title":"Psalms 87:4","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"PSA","chapterStart":87,"verseStart":4,"chapterEnd":87,"verseEnd":4},"content":"<p>Rahab. 89:10; Isa 51:9 Babylon. 137:1,8,9; 2Ki 20:17,18; Isa 13:1-22; 14:4-6; Jer 25:9; 50:1-51:64 Da 2:47,48; 4:30; Re 17:5; 18:2 Tyre. 45:12; Isa 23:1-18; Eze 27:1-28:26 Ethiopia. 1Ki 10:1-29; Ac 8:27 this man. 68:31; 1Sa 17:8; 2Sa 21:16-22; Isa 19:11,23-25; Eze 28:2</p>"},{"id":"tsk-psa-87-5","title":"Psalms 87:5","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"PSA","chapterStart":87,"verseStart":5,"chapterEnd":87,"verseEnd":5},"content":"<p>of Zion. Isa 44:4,5; 60:1-9; Joh 1:12-14; 3:3-5; Ga 3:26-28; Heb 11:32-40 Heb 12:1,2,22-24; 1Pe 1:23,24 highest. Eze 48:35; Mt 16:18; Ro 8:31</p>"},{"id":"tsk-psa-87-6","title":"Psalms 87:6","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"PSA","chapterStart":87,"verseStart":6,"chapterEnd":87,"verseEnd":6},"content":"<p>when. 22:30; Isa 4:3; Eze 9:4; 13:9; Lu 10:20; Php 4:3; Re 13:8 this man. Jer 3:19; Ga 4:26-31; Re 20:15</p>"},{"id":"tsk-psa-87-7","title":"Psalms 87:7","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"PSA","chapterStart":87,"verseStart":7,"chapterEnd":87,"verseEnd":7},"content":"<p>As well. 68:24,25; 1Ch 15:16-29; 23:5; 25:1-6; Re 14:1-3 all my. 46:4; Isa 12:3; Joh 1:16; 4:10,14; 7:37-39; Jas 1:17; Re 21:6 Re 22:1,17</p>"}]}